    "media:imagetext": "OVERSEAS NATIONAL AIRWAYS\nDOUGLAS DC-8-60 SERIES\nTake-off and landing\nStart und Landung\nDécollage et\natterrissage\nDespegue y aterrizaje\nDecolagem e\naterrissagem\nDecollo e atterraggio\nSAFETY PROCEDURES\nSICHERHEIT AN BOARD\nNOTICE DE SECURITE\nNo smoking\nEmergency exit\nRemove shoes\nNicht rauchen\nNotausgang\nSchuhe ausziehen\nNe pas fumer\nEXIT\nSortie de secours\nEnlever les souliers\nNo fumar\nSalida de urgencia\nDescalzar\nNao fumar\nSaida de emergência\nDescalçar os sapatos\nNon fumare\nUscita di emergenza\nTogliere le scarpe\n\"Апауорейста:\n\"ELOdOS KIVOUVOU\nByáTE та папойтаа\njail taien\nOXYGEN\nOxygen\nSauerstoff\nOxygène\nOxigeno\nOxigênio\nOssigeno\n3\n4\nMAIN CABIN DOORS\nEXIT\nA\n2\n3\n10 0\n2\nPull handle in\nand down.\nJET ESCAPE DOORS\nLet go of handle when\nexit starts to fall out.\nRemove shoes and\nall sharp objects.\nJump and sil\nin slide\nNO SHOES\nEXIT\nB\nOXYGEN",
